 R←Test_30(stopFlag batchFlag);⎕TRAP;parms;filename1;filename2
⍝ Two crashes in quick succession must not collide: file names carry milliseconds
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '. ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')
 R←T._Failed

⍝ Preconditions...
 parms←##.HandleError.CreateParms
 parms.errorFolder←GetTempPath⊃⎕SI
 parms.(killThreads saveErrorWS createHTML saveVars)←0
 parms.signal←501
 {}FilesAndDirs.RmDir parms.errorFolder

 :Trap 501
     ##.HandleError.Process parms
     →T.GoToTidyUp 1
 :EndTrap
 filename1←parms.∆ERROR_WS

 :Trap 501
     ##.HandleError.Process parms
     →T.GoToTidyUp 1
 :EndTrap
 filename2←parms.∆ERROR_WS

 →T.GoToTidyUp filename1≡filename2
 →T.GoToTidyUp 2≠≢FilesAndDirs.ListFiles parms.errorFolder,'/*.dcf'

 R←T._OK

∆TidyUp:
 {}FilesAndDirs.RmDir parms.errorFolder
